        }
       },
       "html": "<p>My name is Daniel Speicher and I got the opportunity to go on the Irish Life Experience in the summer of 2019.  I would highly recommend the ILE to anyone who wants an exciting summer trip around Ireland and see what the country has to offer.  Some of my favorite attractions in Ireland were the Cliffs of Moher and the Aran Islands.  During ILE, you will make lifelong friends and it will be an experience you will never forget.</p><p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to me!</p>"
      },
